    "meteorologist": "Rojan Lamichhane",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको प्रभाव रहेको छ। हाल मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा  पूर्वतर्फ सरदर स्थानको आसपास तथा पश्चिम मा सरदर स्थानभन्दा उत्तरतर्फ नेपालको नजिक रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, monsoon winds are prevailing across the country. The monsoon trough is currently located around its normal position in the east and to the north of its normal position, close to Nepal, in the west.",
    "today_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। देशको तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। बागमती, गण्डकी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई  स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are expected across the country.  Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Himalayan and hilly regions. Moderate rainfall is likely at a few places in the Terai region. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। देशको तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। बागमती, गण्डकी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई  स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are expected across the country.   Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Himalayan and hilly regions. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Terai region of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces and at a few places in Madhesh, Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, and Karnali Provinces and in the hilly and Terai regions of Lumbini Province.",
